00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:42.782
and enjoying the time out there and,

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:43.082
you know,

00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:43.750
seeing the desert

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:44.517
and walking

00:04:44.517 --> 00:04:45.618
