00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:47.954
Hey, I'll give you a ride

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:48.655
the next two miles

00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:50.857
and we gladly took it and

00:04:51.724 --> 00:04:52.292
we had a good time

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:52.925
in the back of the truck.

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:54.560
We rode for about four miles of the city,

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.995
and we sat in a bar for a while

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:56.629
and hung out with people

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.431
and finally found a ride arena.

00:04:58.431 --> 00:04:59.365
It was like

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:00.033
the old times,

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:01.501
you know, just just this caravan

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:03.069
and across the country,

00:05:03.069 --> 00:05:05.605
anything for that kid free tickets or

00:05:06.406 --> 00:05:09.742
signed Diplomas merch yeah, I got it.

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:10.410
I got his number.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.744
He lives he lives in about it

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:13.079
is going to come to some shows.

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:13.713
The name was Tony.

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:15.281
