00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:23.890
And he had some beer

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.124
and we just got in the back of the car.

00:05:25.124 --> 00:05:26.259
We just drove for 3 hours

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:27.660
to do something like Neil Young and just

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.128
drank some beers. And

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:31.197
somehow I made

00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:32.198
the flight and I made the show.

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:32.799
I have no idea

00:05:32.799 --> 00:05:33.299
what happened,

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.568
but then went to my show in D.C.

00:05:35.568 --> 00:05:36.836
It had a great time and now I'm back.

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:38.104
Back in Nevada now

00:05:38.104 --> 00:05:40.173
here in Las Vegas for a party.

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:42.141
And yeah, I'm glad I made it up,

00:05:42.141 --> 00:05:43.810
but I think I think it's people

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:44.477
that Bernie made.

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:45.812
Organizers are very prepared.

00:05:45.812 --> 00:05:46.779
It doesn't rain often

00:05:46.779 --> 00:05:47.447
it's the first time,

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:48.181
I think, in history

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:49.282
it rained during the festival,

00:05:49.282 --> 00:05:50.883
but it rains sometimes

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:51.651
and they're prepared

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:54.120
for this kind of situation.

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:56.522
I just think the luck of that art

00:05:56.522 --> 00:05:59.058
navigating and camping and able to handle

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:00.993
themselves might have been scared, but

00:06:00.993 --> 00:06:02.195
it wasn't that bad.

00:06:02.195 --> 00:06:03.663
There wasn't any Ebola breakout.

00:06:03.663 --> 00:06:04.397
Like like I said,

00:06:04.397 --> 00:06:06.265
it means there wasn't any cannibalism.

00:06:07.233 --> 00:06:08.267
But it was having a good time.

00:06:08.267 --> 00:06:08.468
People

00:06:08.468 --> 00:06:09.635
