00:06:20.947 --> 00:06:24.183
it sounds potentially better than what

00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:26.619
I know Burning Man would have been.

00:06:26.619 --> 00:06:28.354
Diplo, we really appreciate the time.

00:06:28.354 --> 00:06:29.188
Glad you got out.

00:06:29.188 --> 00:06:30.323
Awesome. You got to D.C.

00:06:30.323 --> 00:06:31.557
and then I guess back

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:32.725
