00:07:39.192 --> 00:07:40.693
because they're waiting for thousands

00:07:40.693 --> 00:07:42.361
and thousands to try to get out

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:44.664
but the people that get out their cars

00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:46.132
look like this.

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:46.566
And the people

00:07:46.566 --> 00:07:47.767
that are trying to walk out

00:07:47.767 --> 00:07:48.401
have told me, look,

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:49.836
it's taken me 3 hours.

00:07:49.836 --> 00:07:51.170
What they end up doing

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:53.039
is that they get these plastic bags

00:07:53.039 --> 00:07:56.042
and wrap their shoes with duct tape.

00:07:56.042 --> 00:07:56.709
And they've told me

00:07:56.709 --> 00:07:58.411
that really is the only way

00:07:58.411 --> 00:08:00.480
that you can walk for miles and miles

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.447
as you try to get out

00:08:01.447 --> 00:08:04.450
to make it to this road to the main exit.

00:08:04.884 --> 00:08:07.286
Again, it's just difficult.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.621
People were not expecting

00:08:08.621 --> 00:08:10.656
so much rain, so much mud,

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:11.757
but a lot of people

00:08:11.757 --> 00:08:12.859
that I've talked to have remained

00:08:12.859 --> 00:08:14.594
extremely positive.

00:08:14.594 --> 00:08:15.127
Look,

00:08:15.228 --> 00:08:15.661
they say

00:08:15.661 --> 00:08:17.597
they've had a great time at the festival.

00:08:17.597 --> 00:08:18.364
They say

00:08:18.364 --> 00:08:20.967
that they have enjoyed their time here.

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:22.301
And they're trying to make the best

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:24.303
out of a very difficult situation.

00:08:24.303 --> 00:08:25.771
But officials are telling them

00:08:25.771 --> 00:08:26.606
conserve food,

00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:27.940
conserve water, fuel,

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.742
because if they do have to stay here

00:08:29.742 --> 00:08:30.810
for extra days,

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:31.444
a lot of them

00:08:31.444 --> 00:08:33.813
do not have enough food or water

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:35.781
for just a number of days

00:08:35.781 --> 00:08:37.550
that they had no plan for it.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.885
That's really the concern

00:08:38.885 --> 00:08:39.652
for a lot of people.

00:08:39.652 --> 00:08:41.053
They have been sharing

00:08:41.053 --> 00:08:42.021
This is an event

00:08:42.021 --> 00:08:43.322
where people

00:08:43.322 --> 00:08:46.325
essentially feel free to self express,

00:08:46.325 --> 00:08:48.361
to create art, to come together.

00:08:48.361 --> 00:08:49.996
So you're seeing those vibes,

00:08:49.996 --> 00:08:52.198
you're seeing that positivity.

00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:53.733
But officials here are saying

00:08:53.733 --> 00:08:54.500
just be careful

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.268
because you still

00:08:55.268 --> 00:08:57.203
may not be able to get out today.

00:08:57.203 --> 00:08:57.637
They're saying

00:08:57.637 --> 00:08:58.604
they're going to look again

00:08:58.604 --> 00:09:00.139
when the sun comes out, decide

00:09:00.139 --> 00:09:01.841
after they look at the mud

00:09:01.841 --> 00:09:02.708
and the conditions

00:09:02.708 --> 00:09:05.344
and how things improve or not.

00:09:05.344 --> 00:09:06.612
So in the meantime,

00:09:06.612 --> 00:09:07.680
we're just waiting for the sun

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.849
to come up to see how things are going to

00:09:09.849 --> 00:09:11.117
end up going for today.

00:09:11.117 --> 00:09:13.352
But so far, it's still looking muddy

00:09:13.352 --> 00:09:15.187
and it's still looking messy.

00:09:15.187 --> 00:09:17.056
So we do expect to see people coming out.

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:18.391
The question is whether officials

00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:20.126
will give them that green light

00:09:20.126 --> 00:09:21.060
and make it official.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.762
Guys. Yeah, wait and see.

00:09:22.762 --> 00:09:23.529
Hopefully lives

00:09:23.529 --> 00:09:24.330
can be like we're reporting.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:24.897
Thanks so much.

